# Shoulder on FHIR — Profile Validation ($validate operation)
# VS Code REST Client (humao.rest-client)
# Tenant endpoint: http://localhost:8080/fhir/DEFAULT
#
# HAPI returns OperationOutcome:
#   issue.severity "error"       → validation FAILED
#   issue.severity "information" → validation PASSED (informational only)
#   issue.severity "warning"     → passed but with warnings
#
# PREREQUISITE: profiles must be loaded — run ./seed/load-profiles.sh first.

@base = http://localhost:8080/fhir/DEFAULT


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# EXISTING SERVER RESOURCES — validate live data against profiles
# Uses the GET …/$validate form: HAPI re-validates the stored resource.
# All seed patients/conditions/observations self-declare meta.profile,
# so HAPI knows which profile to validate against automatically.
#
# These reference Kemal Demir's (PAT-LONG-002) fixed logical IDs from the
# seed data (seed/bundles/kemal-demir/) — deterministic and stable across
# reloads, unlike HAPI-assigned resource IDs.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Validate existing Patient (PAT-LONG-002 Kemal Demir) against ShoulderPatient
GET {{base}}/Patient/pat-long-002/$validate
Accept: application/fhir+json

###

### Validate existing Condition (seed RotatorCuffCondition) against its profile
GET {{base}}/Condition/kemal-demir-rc-tear/$validate
Accept: application/fhir+json

###

### Validate existing Observation (Patte classification) against its profile
GET {{base}}/Observation/kemal-demir-patte/$validate
Accept: application/fhir+json

###

### Validate existing Observation (Goutallier classification) against its profile
GET {{base}}/Observation/kemal-demir-goutallier/$validate
Accept: application/fhir+json


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# VALID RESOURCES — expect no errors
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Validate a valid ShoulderPatient
POST {{base}}/Patient/$validate?profile=https://maxpurk.github.io/shoulder-on-fhir/StructureDefinition/shoulder-patient
Content-Type: application/fhir+json
Accept: application/fhir+json

{
  "resourceType": "Patient",
  "meta": {
    "profile": ["https://maxpurk.github.io/shoulder-on-fhir/StructureDefinition/shoulder-patient"]
  },
  "identifier": [
    {
      "system": "https://maxpurk.github.io/shoulder-on-fhir/identifier/patient-id",
      "value": "PAT-VALIDATE-001"
    }
  ],
  "name": [
    {
      "family": "Mustermann",
      "given": ["Max"]
    }
  ],
  "gender": "male",
  "birthDate": "1975-03-15"
}
# Note: hand dominance is NOT a Patient extension. Per ADR-0026 it is captured
# as a separate HandDominanceObservation (Observation.code = SNOMED CT 57427004
# "Handedness", Observation.valueCodeableConcept from the HandDominance ValueSet).

###

### Validate a valid RotatorCuffCondition
POST {{base}}/Condition/$validate?profile=https://maxpurk.github.io/shoulder-on-fhir/StructureDefinition/rotator-cuff-condition
Content-Type: application/fhir+json
Accept: application/fhir+json

{
  "resourceType": "Condition",
  "meta": {
    "profile": ["https://maxpurk.github.io/shoulder-on-fhir/StructureDefinition/rotator-cuff-condition"]
  },
  "clinicalStatus": {
    "coding": [
      {
        "system": "http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/condition-clinical",
        "code": "active"
      }
    ]
  },
  "verificationStatus": {
    "coding": [
      {
        "system": "http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/condition-ver-status",
        "code": "confirmed"
      }
    ]
  },
  "category": [
    {
      "coding": [
        {
          "system": "http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/condition-category",
          "code": "encounter-diagnosis"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "code": {
    "coding": [
      {
        "system": "http://snomed.info/sct",
        "code": "926335004",
        "display": "Rupture of rotator cuff of shoulder"
      }
    ]
  },
  "bodySite": [
    {
      "coding": [
        {
          "system": "http://snomed.info/sct",
          "code": "91774008",
          "display": "Structure of right shoulder region"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "subject": {
    "reference": "Patient/pat-long-002"
  }
}

###

### Validate a valid Observation (Jobe Test — provocation, CodeableConcept value)
POST {{base}}/Observation/$validate?profile=https://maxpurk.github.io/shoulder-on-fhir/StructureDefinition/jobe-test-observation
Content-Type: application/fhir+json
Accept: application/fhir+json

{
  "resourceType": "Observation",
  "meta": {
    "profile": ["https://maxpurk.github.io/shoulder-on-fhir/StructureDefinition/jobe-test-observation"]
  },
  "status": "final",
  "category": [
    {
      "coding": [
        {
          "system": "http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/observation-category",
          "code": "exam"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "code": {
    "coding": [
      {
        "system": "http://snomed.info/sct",
        "code": "1231437004",
        "display": "Empty can test"
      }
    ]
  },
  "subject": {
    "reference": "Patient/pat-long-002"
  },
  "effectiveDateTime": "2024-06-01",
  "valueCodeableConcept": {
    "coding": [
      {
        "system": "http://snomed.info/sct",
        "code": "10828004",
        "display": "Positive"
      }
    ]
  }
}

###

### Validate a valid Observation (Constant Score — Quantity value)
POST {{base}}/Observation/$validate?profile=https://maxpurk.github.io/shoulder-on-fhir/StructureDefinition/constant-score-observation
Content-Type: application/fhir+json
Accept: application/fhir+json

{
  "resourceType": "Observation",
  "meta": {
    "profile": ["https://maxpurk.github.io/shoulder-on-fhir/StructureDefinition/constant-score-observation"]
  },
  "status": "final",
  "category": [
    {
      "coding": [
        {
          "system": "http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/observation-category",
          "code": "survey"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "code": {
    "coding": [
      {
        "system": "http://snomed.info/sct",
        "code": "273383002",
        "display": "Constant and Murley shoulder assessment score"
      }
    ]
  },
  "subject": {
    "reference": "Patient/pat-long-002"
  },
  "effectiveDateTime": "2024-06-01",
  "valueQuantity": {
    "value": 78,
    "unit": "score",
    "system": "http://unitsofmeasure.org",
    "code": "{score}"
  }
}


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# INVALID RESOURCES — expect errors in OperationOutcome
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### INVALID Patient — missing required name
POST {{base}}/Patient/$validate?profile=https://maxpurk.github.io/shoulder-on-fhir/StructureDefinition/shoulder-patient
Content-Type: application/fhir+json
Accept: application/fhir+json

{
  "resourceType": "Patient",
  "meta": {
    "profile": ["https://maxpurk.github.io/shoulder-on-fhir/StructureDefinition/shoulder-patient"]
  },
  "gender": "male"
}

###

# NEGATIVE TEST (retired) — Patient.extension[hand-dominance]
#
# This block previously posted a Patient with an `extension[hand-dominance]`
# expecting rejection. The extension was never published as a StructureDefinition;
# per ADR-0026, hand dominance is captured as a separate `HandDominanceObservation`
# resource, not as a Patient extension. The HAPI validator no longer flags this
# the way it used to — unknown extensions are typically accepted as `modifierExtension:false`
# anonymous data — so the test is preserved only as a comment for historical context.
# To exercise hand-dominance validation today, POST a HandDominanceObservation
# with `Observation.code = SNOMED CT 57427004 "Handedness"` and
# `Observation.valueCodeableConcept` bound to the `HandDominance` ValueSet (SNOMED CT
# 46669005 right / 87683000 left / 23088002 ambidextrous).
